  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/evuJ/340",
  "contentHtml": "<p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\"><span style=\"color: #0078cb;\"><b>에듀테크의 끝판왕은 </b></span></span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\"><b><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\">바이브코딩</span>이라 생각합니다</b></span></p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #ff0010;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\"><b>바이브코딩으로 만든</b></span></p><p><span style=\"color: #ff0010;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\"><b>패들렛 메모장(포스트잇) 기능 가진</b></span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\"><span style=\"color: #ff0010;\"><b>나만의 앱&#160; </b></span><b></b></span></p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><hr data-ke-style=\"style1\"><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\"><b>[ 학생 모드 ]</b></span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f86b8bf0ff71ee411db39258bee9e412681dcfc0\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f86b8bf0ff71ee411db39258bee9e412681dcfc0\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"394\"></div><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">로그인을 합니다 ^^</span></p><hr data-ke-style=\"style1\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4a0572b8817ece840ffe4a0b0e945f565f89dbc2\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4a0572b8817ece840ffe4a0b0e945f565f89dbc2\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"342\"></div><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">로그인을 하면</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">참여할 수 있는 패들렛(메모장) 목록이 나옵니다</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">패들렛은 마스터 기능을 가진 사람이 </span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">계속 만들 수 있습니다.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">그것은 뒤에 설명.</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">패들렛의 종류(?)는</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">익명과 익명이 아닌 형태로 나눌 수 있습니다.</span></p><hr data-ke-style=\"style1\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/dacbeb31dfcc227c930d550cd08d282190778e62\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/dacbeb31dfcc227c930d550cd08d282190778e62\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"241\"></div><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">위 사진은 누가 썼는지 보이는 패들렛임.</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">위와 같은 패들렛에 들어가면</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">누가 작성했는지 알 수 있습니다</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">자기가 쓴 메모를 </span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">수정하거나 삭제할 수 있습니다.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">(익명 패들렛이든 아니든)</span></p><hr data-ke-style=\"style1\"><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0c8a9e46a2aa0908b642954381b6e71c6dc8ba7f\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0c8a9e46a2aa0908b642954381b6e71c6dc8ba7f\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"335\"></div><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">오른쪽 하단 (+) 버튼 누르면 </span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">메모가 작성 됩니다.</span></p><hr data-ke-style=\"style1\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a85ee0f312a290eeb584520eb79d14b7770d64eb\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a85ee0f312a290eeb584520eb79d14b7770d64eb\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"277\"></div><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">또한 좋아요 표시도 할 수 있습니다</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">본인이 작성한 글에는 할 수 없고</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">친구들이 작성한 것에 대해 좋아요 표시 할 수 있습니다.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">좋아요는 1인당 하나의 패들렛당 </span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">총 3개만 표시 할 수 있습니다.</span></p><hr data-ke-style=\"style1\"><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/27bd2dc2a95d7385464262e4da610869a241bd52\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/27bd2dc2a95d7385464262e4da610869a241bd52\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"182\"></div><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">익명 패들렛의 경우</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">본인이 쓴 것만 확인되고 </span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">나머지는 익명처리되어 보여집니다</span></p><hr data-ke-style=\"style1\"><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\"><span style=\"color: #ff0010;\"><b>[</b></span><span style=\"color: #ff0010;\"><b>마스터 모드]</b></span></span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a9e7855d80bd997c01cbb67fc34b3e7abadc6227\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a9e7855d80bd997c01cbb67fc34b3e7abadc6227\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"500\"></div><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">마스터로 로그인을 하면</span></span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">위 사진처럼 나옵니다</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">총 패드렛 목록이 보이며</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">익명인지 아닌지 보이고</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">또한 몇 반 용인지도 보입니다</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">새 패들렛 만들기 버튼을 누르면</span></p><hr data-ke-style=\"style1\"><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8a3bc8440762bdc9cd751fa3e6c1636b9dceb8d7\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8a3bc8440762bdc9cd751fa3e6c1636b9dceb8d7\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"524\"></div><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">패들렛 생성할 수 있는 화면이 나옵니다 ^^</span></p><hr data-ke-style=\"style1\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/42682a74bec6f55338f1eb3c2c0eaf05e305355c\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/42682a74bec6f55338f1eb3c2c0eaf05e305355c\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"195\"></div><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">마스터로 로그인하면</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">익명처리된 패들렛이여도 </span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">누가 작성했는지 보입니다.</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">학생들은 안보이는데 마스터는 보인다는 것.</span></span></p><hr data-ke-style=\"style1\"><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #ff0010;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\"><b>[ 체험판 ]</b></span></p><p><span style=\"color: #ff0010;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\"><b>아래 링크로 들어가시면 </b></span></p><p><span style=\"color: #ff0010;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\"><b>체험 하실 수 있습니다.</b></span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\"><a href=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbxfx-4CnH_2NI1_NuUT0lE6Ylv9F_YV28j7vtUXu9annVdn6SeN-jUxm44DwWHgygnJqg/exec\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbxfx-4CnH_2NI1_NuUT0lE6Ylv9F_YV28j7vtUXu9annVdn6SeN-jUxm44DwWHgygnJqg/exec</a></span></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"미니 패들렛\" data-og-description=\"\" data-og-host=\"script.google.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbxfx-4CnH_2NI1_NuUT0lE6Ylv9F_YV28j7vtUXu9annVdn6SeN-jUxm44DwWHgygnJqg/exec\" data-og-url=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbxfx-4CnH_2NI1_NuUT0lE6Ylv9F_YV28j7vtUXu9annVdn6SeN-jUxm44DwWHgygnJqg/exec\" data-og-image=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\"><a href=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbxfx-4CnH_2NI1_NuUT0lE6Ylv9F_YV28j7vtUXu9annVdn6SeN-jUxm44DwWHgygnJqg/exec\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbxfx-4CnH_2NI1_NuUT0lE6Ylv9F_YV28j7vtUXu9annVdn6SeN-jUxm44DwWHgygnJqg/exec\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">미니 패들렛</p><p class=\"og-desc\"></p><p class=\"og-host\">script.google.com</p></div></a></div><p>&#160;</p><hr data-ke-style=\"style1\"><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>학생모드로</b></span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"> 로그인하시려면</span></span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">학급(반)은 </span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>10반</b></span></span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">번호와 이름은 아래 표를 보시고 </span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">학생모드로 로그인 해보세요</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c3b97bcfd154da94cc9f24e8caaa0a8cb1d4f1bb\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c3b97bcfd154da94cc9f24e8caaa0a8cb1d4f1bb\" data-origin-width=\"353\" data-origin-height=\"351\"></div><hr data-ke-style=\"style1\"><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\"><b>[마스터 모드] 로 로그인 방법은</b></span></p><p><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\"><b>학급(반) : 11반</b></span></p><p><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\"><b>번호 1번, 이름: 마스터</b></span></p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
